<title>EGYPT: Egypt offers 182-day T-bills worth 1.3 billion.</title>
<headline>Egypt offers 182-day T-bills worth 1.3 billion.</headline>
<dateline>CAIRO 1997-05-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Egyptian treasury offered 182-day treasury bills worth 1.3 billion pounds for auction on June 2 issue on June 3 when 182-day bills worth 991 million pounds mature.</p>
<p>The average yield at the last auction was 9.029 percent.</p>
<p>$1 = 3.40 pounds</p>
</text>
